---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`${SITE_TITLE} - Pen and Paper - About`} description="About pen and paper content" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>About</h1>
			<p>
				This is a place where I gather informations about my Campaign(s) and share that with you!
				This website and all content on here is explicitly public, despite that please do not share this website with larger groups or forums.
				<br> 
				You can always share it with friends!
				<br> <br>
				This website was created by me! Julie Lucia Hildebrandt. Want to contact me? Write me an email: julie.lucia.hildebrandt@gmail.com
			</p>
			
			<hr>

			<h3>Scheduling Page</h3>
			<p>
				The scheduling page shows all upcoming and past sessions, prominently showing the next session at the top of the page.
				Each session shows a countdown to when it starts, and all times are automatically converted from Berlin time to your local timezone. If you're already in my timezone, only one time is shown.
				Sessions are tagged as either "Main Session" or "Optional Session" so you know which ones are which. If a session gets cancelled, it will still appear but with a clear "Cancelled" label.
				For upcoming sessions, you can vote on your availability. You can change your vote at any time, or click your current selection again to remove it.
		
				<br> <br>

				<strong>IMPORTANT:</strong> When you vote on any scheduling vote, your vote is saved in the database and the vote is saved in your browser. 
				Using the same browser and device will allow you to see and change your vote. Since the votes are anonymous the website does not remember who has voted, it only remembers what was voted for. 
				The only way to see if you have voted and change your vote is through the browser and device you originally voted from. 
			</p>

			<hr>

			<h3>Wiki Page</h3>
			<p>
				The wiki is a growing encyclopedia of information about the campaign, world, characters, and lore. I use "Categories" to organize the wiki. For example, all characters in our world of Abaron are in the category "Characters". 
				Art used in the wiki is not mine. It has either been taken from the internet or has been created by my talented players. 
			</p>

			<hr>

			<h3>Library Page</h3>
			<p>
				The library is a the file sharing space for me and my players, allowing me to share rulesets with my players easily. I paid for the rules and files in the library, which is why it requires a login, so I can control who has access to it. 
				<br>
				If you want access to the library, please send me a text with your preferred Username and I'll send you a link to set up a password and create your account. 
				<br> <br>
				It goes without saying, but please do not share content of the library without my consent.
			</p>

			<hr>

			<h3>About Page</h3>
			<p>You're here! This page explains what each section of the Tavern does and how to use it.</p>
		</main>
		<Footer/>
	</body>
</html>